  "ruleText": "Lab 1502.02 \"Client company\" means “client company” as defined in RSA 277-B:2, III, namely “a person who enters into an employee leasing arrangement with an employee leasing company.”\n\nSource. #6626, eff 11-4-97, EXPIRED: 11-4-05\n\nNew. #10221, eff 11-3-12, ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22 (formerly Lab 1502.03)",
